WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.008 --> 00:00:02.242
[Studio audience laughing over TV]

00:00:02.242 --> 00:00:03.359
WANDA MAXIMOFF
Who are those people?

00:00:03.359 --> 00:00:04.094
VISION
What are you wearing?

00:00:04.094 --> 00:00:05.133
WANDA MAXIMOFF
Why are they here?

00:00:05.133 --> 00:00:06.164
VISION
What are you wearing?

00:00:06.164 --> 00:00:07.508
WANDA MAXIMOFF
Well, it's our anniversary!

00:00:07.508 --> 00:00:08.891
VISION
Our anniversary of what?

00:00:08.891 --> 00:00:09.820
WANDA MAXIMOFF
Well, if you don't know,

00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:11.240
I'm not going to tell you!

00:00:11.514 --> 00:00:12.311
JIMMY WOO
Is that...

00:00:12.311 --> 00:00:14.116
DARCY LEWIS
Yeah, it looks like her.

00:00:14.116 --> 00:00:15.272
WANDA MAXIMOFF
You move at the speed of sound,

00:00:15.272 --> 00:00:16.952
and I can make a
pen float through the air.

00:00:16.952 --> 00:00:18.400
Who needs to abbreviate?

00:00:19.671 --> 00:00:21.662
DARCY LEWIS
Look, I know it's been a crazy few years

00:00:21.662 --> 00:00:24.584
on this planet, but he's dead, right?

00:00:24.584 --> 00:00:26.817
Not blipped, dead.

00:00:26.817 --> 00:00:29.042
VISION
Excellent plan. Where's the tenderizer?

00:00:29.042 --> 00:00:31.006
DIRECTOR HAYWARD
What am I looking at?

00:00:31.006 --> 00:00:33.951
You? What is this?
Where is this coming from?

00:00:33.951 --> 00:00:34.792
DARCY LEWIS
Out there.

00:00:34.792 --> 00:00:36.232
AGNES
You didn't answer the back door.

00:00:36.232 --> 00:00:37.974
For your upside-down cake.

00:00:37.974 --> 00:00:40.351
Oh! Hi, I...

00:00:40.351 --> 00:00:41.521
DIRECTOR HAYWARD
Is it authentic?

00:00:41.521 --> 00:00:42.623
DARCY LEWIS
I'm not sure how to answer that.

00:00:42.623 --> 00:00:43.709
DIRECTOR HAYWARD
Is it happening in real time?

00:00:43.709 --> 00:00:45.404
Is it recorded, fabricated?

00:00:45.404 --> 00:00:47.107
DARCY LEWIS
I don't know. I don't know.

00:00:47.107 --> 00:00:48.307
And I don't know.

00:00:48.307 --> 00:00:50.114
DIRECTOR HAYWARD
What do you know?

00:00:50.114 --> 00:00:51.742
DARCY LEWIS
My equipment registered an extremely

00:00:51.742 --> 00:00:53.601
high level of CMBR. That's...

00:00:53.601 --> 00:00:54.972
DIRECTOR HAYWARD
Relic radiation dating back

00:00:54.972 --> 00:00:55.890
to the Big Bang.

00:00:55.890 --> 00:00:58.827
DARCY LEWIS
Yeah, entwined was a broadcast frequency.

00:00:58.827 --> 00:01:01.492
So I had your goons
pick me up a sweet vintage TV.

00:01:01.492 --> 00:01:04.884
And when I plug this bad boy in,
voilà, sound and picture.

00:01:04.884 --> 00:01:07.000
WANDA MAXIMOFF
Dinner is served.

00:01:10.150 --> 00:01:12.001
JIMMY WOO
So you're saying the universe created

00:01:12.001 --> 00:01:14.384
a sitcom starring two Avengers?

00:01:14.384 --> 00:01:15.884
MRS HART
[on TV] European.

00:01:15.884 --> 00:01:17.002
DARCY LEWIS
It's a working theory.

